kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "execution-refloader-chunk-parallelism"
purpose: "在 keys 模式 `lookup_chunk_size` 分片路径上提供 opt-in 的同 LoadRef 多 chunk 并行；默认串行；合并语义与 `ir-source-relations` r694 串行分片一致。 [c30-refloader-chunk-parallelism]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[8]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r970,"Chunk parallelism is opt-in and adaptive-only","系统 MUST 仅在同时满足以下条件时对同一 `LoadRef(keys)` 步骤内由 `lookup_chunk_size` 产生的多片 loader 调用启用并行：(1) `parallel_mode=adaptive`；(2) 运行时显式 opt-in（Python `DemandRunRuntimeOptions` / `PipelineOverrides` 布尔推荐名 `parallelize_lookup_chunks`）。当 `parallel_mode=seq`、未 opt-in、或仅设置了 `lookup_chunk_size` 时系统 MUST 保持今日串行分片。系统 MUST NOT 新增 YAML 键作为并行开关；`lookup_chunk_size` MUST 仍仅表示分片大小（见 `demand-dsl` r6）。"
  r971,"Chunk merge equals serial first-wins","opt-in 并行路径的 key-row 合并结果 MUST 与串行分片路径完全一致：按 keys 列表上的 chunk offset 升序应用各片结果；同 key 冲突时先写入者胜（与 `ir-source-relations` r694 / 今日 `_load_ref_chunked` 一致）。系统 MUST NOT 改为 last-wins、随机序合并或因冲突失败除非另开 breaking change。"
  r972,"Global in-flight cap equals resolved adaptive workers","并行分片 MUST 使用独立于 adaptive LoadRef fan-out 池的 chunk 执行器（避免同池嵌套 wait 死锁）。任意时刻进程内 in-flight ref-loader 调用数 MUST ≤ resolved adaptive workers W；单步扇出另受可选 `max_chunk_workers` 限制。系统 MUST NOT 因在途 LoadRef 与 max_chunk_workers 无帽乘积而无限扩容。"
  r973,"Chunk failures and timeout follow parent LoadRef","任一 chunk 失败时的异常传播与部分结果处理 MUST 与串行分片一致：传播的异常类型/消息、以及 MUST NOT 将半份 merged 映射当作成功返回、MUST NOT 写入半份 `load_ref_cache`。超时与取消 MUST 跟随父 LoadRef / adaptive `task_timeout_s`（见 `execution-adaptive-guardrails`）；系统 MUST NOT 新增独立 chunk timeout 配置。超时或取消时 MUST 尽力取消未完成 chunk futures。说明：并行路径下，失败 offset 之前/之后**已提交且仍在运行**的 chunk MAY 仍会执行完成，因此错误路径上的 loader 调用次数 MAY 高于串行分片（串行在首个失败处即停止后续片）；成功路径的调用次数 MUST 与串行一致。"
  r974,"Cache write once after merge","分片期间（含并行 workers）MUST NOT 写入 `load_ref_cache`；全部 chunk 合并完成后 MUST 至多写一次（与今日串行一致）。`bind.mode=rows` MUST 继续强制不分片（因而也无 chunk 并行）。"
  r975,"Loader call events carry chunk_offset","每个 chunk 的 `loader_call` 事件 MUST 仍发出（条数 = chunk 数；`lookup_key_count` 为当片大小）。并行路径下事件完成序 MAY 与 offset 升序不同；框架 MUST NOT 为排序缓冲整批事件。每条相关事件 MUST 携带可排序身份字段 `chunk_offset`（与 keys 切片起点一致）；串行分片 MAY 同样填充该字段。订阅方若需稳定序 MUST 自行按 `chunk_offset` 排序。当分片 LoadRef 未运行于 adaptive capture 任务中（例如该层按阈值退化为串行）时，这些 `loader_call` 回调 MAY 直接在分片工作线程上并发执行；系统 MUST NOT 承诺主线程单线程回调（`parallel-execution` r735 对本路径的例外）。因此 opt-in 的订阅方（hook / observer / sink）MUST 自行保证线程安全，且该约束 MUST 在用户文档中显式说明。"
  r976,"Preload remains orthogonal","当 source 已 `preload_forever`（或等价预加载命中）导致 LoadRef 早退时系统 MUST NOT 因开启 chunk 并行而额外调用 ref loader。chunk 并行 MUST NOT 改变 preload / workflow cache 层语义。"
  r977,"Default and memory bounds","未 opt-in 时行为 MUST 与改前串行分片比特级兼容（调用次数相同；顺序保持串行）。opt-in 路径峰值 RSS 相对串行分片 MUST 满足变更门槛（≤ +10%）。外部 QPS 风险 MUST 在文档中说明：`lookup_chunk_size` 不是并行开关。"
scenarios[22]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r970,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r970,"seq-never-parallelizes-chunks",`parallel_mode=seq` 且设置了 `lookup_chunk_size` 与 opt-in,执行 keys LoadRef 分片,系统 MUST 串行调用各 chunk loader,true
  r970,"adaptive-without-opt-in-stays-serial",`parallel_mode=adaptive` 但未 opt-in,执行多 chunk LoadRef,系统 MUST 串行分片,true
  r970,"lookup-chunk-size-alone-not-a-switch",仅设置 `lookup_chunk_size` 且未 opt-in,执行,系统 MUST NOT 并行 chunk,true
  r971,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r971,"parallel-merge-equals-serial",同 keys 与同 chunk_size,串行与 opt-in 并行各跑一次,合并后的映射 MUST 完全相等,true
  r971,"first-wins-by-chunk-offset",两 chunk 对同一 key 返回不同值,合并结果,MUST 等于 offset 较小 chunk 的值,true
  r972,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r972,"inflight-capped-by-W",resolved W=2 且单步可扇出更多 chunk,执行并行分片,任意时刻 in-flight loader 调用数 MUST ≤ 2,true
  r973,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r973,"chunk-error-matches-serial",某一 chunk loader 抛错,并行路径失败,语义 MUST 与串行分片一致且不得返回半份成功 merged / 半份 cache,true
  r973,"error-path-inflight-chunks-may-still-run",opt-in 并行分片且某一 chunk 失败时已有其它 chunk 在途,观察 loader 调用与返回,已在途 chunk MAY 仍被调用（调用次数 MAY > 串行）但异常与无半份成功 MUST 与串行一致,true
  r974,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r974,"cache-written-once-after-merge",启用 batch cache 的 keys 分片并行路径,执行一次 LoadRef,`load_ref_cache` MUST 仅在合并后写入一次,true
  r974,"rows-mode-never-chunks",`bind.mode=rows` 且配置了 `lookup_chunk_size`,执行 LoadRef,系统 MUST 单次 loader 调用（不分片或不并行）,true
  r975,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r975,"each-chunk-emits-loader-call-with-offset",N 个 chunk 的并行分片且订阅 `loader_call`,执行,系统 MUST 发出 N 条事件且每条携带 `chunk_offset`,true
  r975,"opt-in-callbacks-may-run-on-chunk-worker-threads",opt-in 并行分片且该 LoadRef 未运行于 adaptive capture 任务中,订阅方接收 `loader_call`,回调 MAY 发生在分片工作线程上而非主线程（订阅方 MUST 线程安全）,true
  r976,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r976,"preload-hit-skips-chunk-loaders",source 已 preload 命中且 opt-in 开启,执行批次 LoadRef,热路径 MUST 不调用 ref loader,true
  r977,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result",true
  r977,"no-opt-in-matches-pre-change-serial",未 opt-in 的分片路径,与改前对照,loader 调用次数与合并结果 MUST 一致,true
